# Collaboration

- One room-name helper; document the pattern (e.g. `page:{pageId}`).
- Authenticate and authorize before applying Yjs updates.
  - `view`: receive updates
  - `comment`: receive updates; comment APIs only
  - `edit`: receive and send Yjs updates
- Presence uses Yjs awareness (avatars, cursor colors).
- Persist updates/snapshots explicitly; document reconnect behavior.
- Redis is for multi-instance pub/sub or equivalent coordination, not page permissions.
- Prove two-browser convergence, reload, and reconnect before UI polish.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
joinRoom(req.query.room);

// ✅ GOOD
const access = await authorizePageRoom({ userId, pageId });
if (!access.canView) return rejectUnauthorized();
```
